{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2022-09-22 16:30:00', 'title': 'NORDSON CORPORATION APPOINTS ANAND PATEL AS VICE PRESIDENT, TREASURY AND FINANCE', 'text': "WESTLAKE, OHIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORDSON CORPORATION (NASDAQ: NDSN) ANNOUNCED THAT ANAND PATEL WILL SUCCEED RAY CUSHING AS VICE PRESIDENT, TREASURY AND FINANCE FOLLOWING RAY'S UPCOMING RETIREMENT. ANAND JOINS NORDSON ON SEPTEMBER 26 FROM O-I GLASS, INC. (NASDAQ: OI), A GLOBAL MANUFACTURING COMPANY, WHERE HE SERVED AS VICE PRESIDENT AND TREASURER. HE HAS HELD ROLES OF INCREASING RESPONSIBILITY AT O-I SINCE 2013, AND PRIOR TO THAT HE WAS A SENIOR MANAGER AT DELOITTE TAX LLP FOR NINE YEARS. JOE KE"}